{
  "bvid": "BV16J4m1P7eW",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "31055d16350fc06eab2966cac41f736dbc277b86cf9113fcbe2805a36dffe965",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 1600,
      "end_ms": 6880,
      "text": "让我们看一下母亲被直销卖啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 10020,
      "end_ms": 13820,
      "text": "就是你你老妈花钱买这个东西只是入入场券啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 13820,
      "end_ms": 15380,
      "text": "他就是赌赌场入场券"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 15380,
      "end_ms": 16520,
      "text": "你告我跟你讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 16520,
      "end_ms": 18600,
      "text": "就是这种某保健品直销集团"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 18600,
      "end_ms": 20350,
      "text": "就是大赌场开赌场的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 20350,
      "end_ms": 21310,
      "text": "它里面这是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 21310,
      "end_ms": 22510,
      "text": "洗头液卖400"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 22510,
      "end_ms": 23590,
      "text": "净水器卖3000"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 23590,
      "end_ms": 25180,
      "text": "这东西就是筹码呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 25180,
      "end_ms": 27420,
      "text": "这个就是开大开小"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 27420,
      "end_ms": 28820,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 28820,
      "end_ms": 29810,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 29810,
      "end_ms": 31100,
      "text": "你妈不傻"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 31100,
      "end_ms": 32420,
      "text": "你就直接跟你说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 32420,
      "end_ms": 34370,
      "text": "妈我知道你这玩意就是他妈赌场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 34370,
      "end_ms": 36410,
      "text": "忽悠人进来赌博的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 36410,
      "end_ms": 41239,
      "text": "OK啊好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 41239,
      "end_ms": 42619,
      "text": "这个小赌怡情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 42619,
      "end_ms": 44629,
      "text": "大赌伤身剧毒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 44629,
      "end_ms": 47850,
      "text": "这个破家灭门的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 48010,
      "end_ms": 50640,
      "text": "我觉得吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 50640,
      "end_ms": 53460,
      "text": "我觉得你妈要这样去搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 53460,
      "end_ms": 56760,
      "text": "那肯定是你爹妈感情肯定出问题了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 56760,
      "end_ms": 59580,
      "text": "你老妈就变赌狗了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 59580,
      "end_ms": 62820,
      "text": "就不要跟我说什么传销直销传销直销不存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 62820,
      "end_ms": 63810,
      "text": "只存在赌博"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 63810,
      "end_ms": 66300,
      "text": "这就是忽悠人赌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 67360,
      "end_ms": 68340,
      "text": "就是赌博"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 69660,
      "end_ms": 71130,
      "text": "然后少部分人赢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 71130,
      "end_ms": 73190,
      "text": "其他人亏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 73890,
      "end_ms": 75500,
      "text": "就这个就赌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 75500,
      "end_ms": 77750,
      "text": "最后谁能够作为庄家离场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 77750,
      "end_ms": 79170,
      "text": "甚至这种赌博呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 79170,
      "end_ms": 80610,
      "text": "那个也算在内战"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 80610,
      "end_ms": 81120,
      "text": "懂吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 81120,
      "end_ms": 82110,
      "text": "司法力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 82110,
      "end_ms": 84259,
      "text": "司法机关的介入"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 84539,
      "end_ms": 86509,
      "text": "打官司被举报了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 86509,
      "end_ms": 88579,
      "text": "而被判定非法了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 88579,
      "end_ms": 89659,
      "text": "哪些人会退场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 89659,
      "end_ms": 93340,
      "text": "哪些人还可以收拾战场吃尸体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 93340,
      "end_ms": 95080,
      "text": "这也是在赌的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 95080,
      "end_ms": 96640,
      "text": "你老妈一意孤行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 96640,
      "end_ms": 98900,
      "text": "说很正常"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 99120,
      "end_ms": 100820,
      "text": "这就是这些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 100820,
      "end_ms": 103170,
      "text": "就是他妈的就是就是赌的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 105270,
      "end_ms": 106830,
      "text": "最后那么关抓起来坐牢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 106830,
      "end_ms": 108500,
      "text": "那谁谁他妈的运气差"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 108500,
      "end_ms": 108920,
      "text": "坐牢了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 108920,
      "end_ms": 110240,
      "text": "谁他妈的钱还在外面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 110240,
      "end_ms": 111140,
      "text": "可以被执行的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 111140,
      "end_ms": 112820,
      "text": "谁还会吃尸体的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 112820,
      "end_ms": 114360,
      "text": "谁能吃到这尸体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 114360,
      "end_ms": 115920,
      "text": "就是这帮鬼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 115920,
      "end_ms": 118380,
      "text": "一天到晚就他妈坐在那边算计的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 118380,
      "end_ms": 120420,
      "text": "你以为他们是吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 120580,
      "end_ms": 122130,
      "text": "他只是表演的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 122130,
      "end_ms": 124020,
      "text": "就互相在比赛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 124020,
      "end_ms": 126720,
      "text": "谁表演的更相信这东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 127120,
      "end_ms": 128970,
      "text": "那个什么叫什么树"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 128970,
      "end_ms": 130860,
      "text": "树玉辉还是叫什么树什么的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 130860,
      "end_ms": 134190,
      "text": "那个那个逼搞的那个还是他好像是个江苏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 134190,
      "end_ms": 136060,
      "text": "江苏苏北人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 136460,
      "end_ms": 138190,
      "text": "盐城哪里的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 138190,
      "end_ms": 140320,
      "text": "就那个无限极啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 140320,
      "end_ms": 142730,
      "text": "我靠这东西谁都知道他是赌场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 142730,
      "end_ms": 144050,
      "text": "那反过来我们讲的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 144050,
      "end_ms": 147709,
      "text": "也就是说现在大街小巷上开满赌场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 147869,
      "end_ms": 148849,
      "text": "这些直销"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 148849,
      "end_ms": 152599,
      "text": "反而他妈的偷偷摸摸的遮遮掩掩的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 152599,
      "end_ms": 155860,
      "text": "这些东西都好到哪里去嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 156140,
      "end_ms": 157959,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 158359,
      "end_ms": 160779,
      "text": "这个就是遮遮掩掩的赌赌博"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 163299,
      "end_ms": 167010,
      "text": "这就是我们就说这是某种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 172780,
      "end_ms": 175350,
      "text": "你觉得你老妈是变成另一种人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 175350,
      "end_ms": 177870,
      "text": "那你就说同样的方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 177870,
      "end_ms": 179760,
      "text": "那就限制他的金钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 179760,
      "end_ms": 180750,
      "text": "限制他的钱呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 180750,
      "end_ms": 182130,
      "text": "不要让他手上有太多钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 182130,
      "end_ms": 183510,
      "text": "但如果是堵着他养老金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 183510,
      "end_ms": 184459,
      "text": "那你也没办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 184459,
      "end_ms": 186640,
      "text": "他愿意这样去读"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 187820,
      "end_ms": 189220,
      "text": "愿意这样去做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 189220,
      "end_ms": 192430,
      "text": "这是这也是阶级矛盾的一个展现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 192430,
      "end_ms": 194620,
      "text": "他这个就是小资产阶级化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 194620,
      "end_ms": 196450,
      "text": "或者他自然阶级化的可能性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 196450,
      "end_ms": 199269,
      "text": "就只能靠一群人倾轧呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 199269,
      "end_ms": 200349,
      "text": "你懂吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 200349,
      "end_ms": 202719,
      "text": "这些互相之间你好我好的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 202719,
      "end_ms": 206870,
      "text": "这些好姐妹其实都知道在互相倾轧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 206870,
      "end_ms": 207740,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 207740,
      "end_ms": 210560,
      "text": "都知道相互之间是我要吃你的尸体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 210560,
      "end_ms": 212150,
      "text": "不知道是你吃我的尸体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 212150,
      "end_ms": 214350,
      "text": "还是我吃你的尸体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 214990,
      "end_ms": 218520,
      "text": "赛着发着骗对面出血出更多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 218520,
      "end_ms": 219750,
      "text": "自己为什么要出血"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 219750,
      "end_ms": 222660,
      "text": "就是要骗别人出更多的血"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 223120,
      "end_ms": 224580,
      "text": "都是他妈老骗子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 229399,
      "end_ms": 233629,
      "text": "你妈是进入了一个在这里欺骗不受谴责的地方"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 233629,
      "end_ms": 235519,
      "text": "互相骗骗了别人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 235519,
      "end_ms": 236059,
      "text": "先倒下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 236059,
      "end_ms": 237690,
      "text": "吃他的尸体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 238270,
      "end_ms": 240990,
      "text": "OK所以在这个意义上讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 240990,
      "end_ms": 242360,
      "text": "你报警随便点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 242360,
      "end_ms": 244160,
      "text": "你怎么处理这个问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 244160,
      "end_ms": 247940,
      "text": "你是说你母亲的这种残忍和这样一种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 247940,
      "end_ms": 250120,
      "text": "可以说是这样一种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 250120,
      "end_ms": 252670,
      "text": "在这里面没有一个是无辜的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 252670,
      "end_ms": 256440,
      "text": "这样一种罪恶你如何去面对面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 256440,
      "end_ms": 258450,
      "text": "你不要以为他就是个受害者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 258450,
      "end_ms": 260310,
      "text": "所有进入这个赌场里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 260310,
      "end_ms": 263650,
      "text": "玩的都是都是指着别人的身家性命"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 263650,
      "end_ms": 266070,
      "text": "指着别人破家灭门去的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 266070,
      "end_ms": 268380,
      "text": "你妈妈在这里面想要挣大钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 268380,
      "end_ms": 272130,
      "text": "唯一一条路就是有六七十个家庭破家灭门了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 272130,
      "end_ms": 273820,
      "text": "他吃到尸体了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 273820,
      "end_ms": 276280,
      "text": "然后这个玩意还被举报了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 277750,
      "end_ms": 279220,
      "text": "你老妈还全身而退"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 279220,
      "end_ms": 281300,
      "text": "逃了扯呼了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 281300,
      "end_ms": 283260,
      "text": "这他就赢了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 283260,
      "end_ms": 286500,
      "text": "你老妈可能就是朝着这个东西放上去的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 286500,
      "end_ms": 287160,
      "text": "他买这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 287160,
      "end_ms": 289380,
      "text": "买这个东西也就是带个热度起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 289380,
      "end_ms": 292250,
      "text": "忽悠他自己周围的那几十个家庭入伙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 292295,
      "end_ms": 294720,
      "text": "其实都是套路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 294720,
      "end_ms": 297420,
      "text": "这技巧什么了不起嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 297420,
      "end_ms": 299160,
      "text": "谁还不会玩这招吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 299160,
      "end_ms": 301430,
      "text": "我靠引狼入室"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 301430,
      "end_ms": 303170,
      "text": "再以邻为壑吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 303170,
      "end_ms": 304970,
      "text": "最后这跑到人家家里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 304970,
      "end_ms": 306440,
      "text": "已经被狼啃了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 306440,
      "end_ms": 309350,
      "text": "啃的那个石头骨头"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 309350,
      "end_ms": 311510,
      "text": "把人肉捡起来煮汤喝啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 311510,
      "end_ms": 313700,
